        // But what about test mode with missing input (map with missing.txt)? In test mode, does it check input existence? For map, desired exists check doesn't involve input existence. Input missing doesn't cause error in test mode? Let's see: map with missing input in test mode: does it show mapping or error? Need to test original. For now, assume test mode doesn't check input existence, just shows mapping (no error). Good.
    } else {
